{
  "name": "02 - Inbox Triage with AI Drafts and Daily Digest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 - Inbox triage\nEvery new email is classified (**sales / support / invoice / spam**), labelled, logged, and **support** emails get an AI draft reply saved as a Gmail *draft* (never auto-sent). A second trigger posts a daily Slack digest.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Credentials: *Gmail OAuth2*, *Google Sheets OAuth2*, *Slack*, *Header Auth* named **Groq API** (`Authorization` = `Bearer gsk_...`, your Groq key).\n2. In Gmail create 4 labels (e.g. AI/Sales, AI/Support, AI/Invoice, AI/Spam).\n3. Run the **helper** at the bottom (Manual Trigger) once to list label IDs, paste them into **Config**.\n4. Fill `sheetId`, `slackChannelId`, `businessName`, `businessContext` (hours, prices, policies: the ONLY facts drafts may use).\n5. Sheet tab *Triage Log* header row: Date, From, Subject, Category, Priority, Needs human, Summary, Draft.\n6. Test with a self-sent email, then activate.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ebaa7d09-d883-54d8-90ac-6f21c59dc045",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -470
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### AI step: Groq via HTTP Request\nCalls Groq's OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions API (`/openai/v1/chat/completions`) with `response_format: json_object`, 3 retries and a fallback, so an AI outage never drops a record.\nModel = **Config -> aiModel** (default `openai/gpt-oss-120b`). Alternatives: `openai/gpt-oss-20b` (faster/cheaper), `qwen/qwen3.8-27b` (third option).\nCredential: Header Auth **Groq API** (`Authorization` = `Bearer gsk_...`).\nGemini or OpenAI instead? Change the URL + body shape (see workflows README).",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ffb93889-3717-5056-b31f-2ff1607f4cd1",
      "name": "AI Note",
